{"module":"mcq","item":{"id":"a2-mcq-perfekt","level":"A2","title":{"de":"Perfekt üben","bn":"Perfekt অনুশীলন","en":"Practise the perfect"},"skill":"grammar","difficulty":2,"questions":[{"id":"a2-q-1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Gestern ___ ich nach Berlin gefahren.","options":["habe","bin","hat","ist"],"answer":1,"explanation":"„fahren“ এক জায়গা থেকে অন্য জায়গায় যাওয়া বোঝায়, তাই „sein“ নেয়; ich → bin।","wrongNotes":["„fahren“ চলাচল বোঝায়, তাই „haben“ নয়।",null,"„hat“ হলো „er/sie/es“-এর রূপ, আর এখানে „sein“ লাগবে।","„ist“ „er/sie/es“-এর রূপ, কর্তা এখানে „ich“।"]},{"id":"a2-q-2","type":"mcq","prompt":"Hast du die Hausaufgaben ___?","options":["machen","gemacht","macht","gemachen"],"answer":1,"explanation":"„machen“-এর Partizip II হলো „gemacht“ (ge- + mach + -t)।"},{"id":"a2-q-3","type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir haben Pizza ___.","options":["gegessen","geesst","essen","gegesst"],"answer":0,"explanation":"„essen“ অনিয়মিত ক্রিয়া, তাই Partizip II „gegessen“।"},{"id":"a2-q-4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Um wie viel Uhr ___ du aufgestanden?","options":["hast","bist","hat","sind"],"answer":1,"explanation":"„aufstehen“ অবস্থার পরিবর্তন বোঝায় (শুয়ে থাকা → ওঠা), তাই „sein“: du bist aufgestanden।"},{"id":"a2-q-5","type":"mcq","prompt":"Welcher Satz ist richtig?","promptBn":"কোন বাক্যটি সঠিক?","options":["Ich habe gekauft ein Handy.","Ich habe ein Handy gekauft.","Ich gekauft habe ein Handy.","Ich ein Handy habe gekauft."],"answer":1,"explanation":"সহায়ক ক্রিয়া „habe“ দ্বিতীয় স্থানে, Partizip II „gekauft“ একদম শেষে।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"a2-mcq-perfekt","level":"A2","test":[]}